<h1><b>MY Favourite Book:"The Great Gatsby"</b></h1>
<p>"The Grates Gatsby", is a novel  written by<b>F.Scott Fitzgerald</b> and was first published in <i>1925</i>.
it is widely considered one of the greatest American novels. the story is set  during the <sup>Roaring Twenties</sup>
and  explores themes of love ,wealth, and the American  Dream .


 The novel's main character,Jay Gatsby,is  famous for his  extravagant parties  and unrequired  love for
 <strong>Daisy Buchaan</strong>.His  story ultimately leads  to tragic  consequence.The Book is  known for  its 
 <small>symbolism</small> and its  critical view  of the American Dream.</p>
